ystem"},{"text":"Understand systems engineering"},{"text":"Write technical requirements and test procedures"},{"text":"Understand FMEA and fault analysis"},{"text":"Complete at least 2 substantial aerospace projects"},{"text":"Complete at least 1 relevant aerospace/space-tech internship"}]}]},{"heading":"Best Overall Positioning","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Space Technology / Avionics","GNC","Embedded Systems","Flight Dynamics","Systems Engineering"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The direct pathway is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["B.Tech/B.E.","Avionics / GNC / Launch Vehicle Engineer","Senior Engineer","Lead Engineer","Principal / Vehicle Systems Engineer"]},{"type":"p","text":"For this particular degree, the strongest strategy is to specialize rather than attempt to master every launch-vehicle subsystem equally."},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly strong profile would be:"},{"type":"flow","items":["GNC","C/C++","MATLAB/Simulink","Embedded Systems","Sensor Fusion","Flight Dynamics"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Alternatively, a student interested in broader vehicle integration can pursue:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Avionics","Systems Engineering","Testing","Telemetry","Vehicle Integration"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"For highly advanced launch-vehicle R&D, propulsion, flight dynamics, and specialized GNC positions, M.Tech/M.S. or equivalent postgraduate specialization can materially improve access to research-intensive roles."}]}]}